WEBVTT

00:03:59.288 --> 00:04:01.788
can conduct signals
100 times faster or more

00:04:01.829 --> 00:04:04.288
than those with thinner ones.

00:04:04.329 --> 00:04:08.163
Some scientists now think
that this difference in myelination

00:04:08.204 --> 00:04:12.163
could be the key to uniform
conduction time in the brain,

00:04:12.204 --> 00:04:16.954
and consequently,
to our mental synthesis ability.

00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:20.913
A lot of this myelination
happens in childhood;

00:04:20.954 --> 00:04:22.871
so, from an early age,

00:04:22.913 --> 00:04:27.246
our vibrant imaginations may have a lot
to do with building up brains

00:04:27.288 --> 00:04:29.163
whose carefully myelinated connections

00:04:29.204 --> 00:04:32.913
can craft creative symphonies
throughout our lives.